    "enUS": {
      "description": "Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?",
      "dialogue": {
        "569008bc5a48957b5735": "Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?",
        "76383def4cd714bf910f": "It pains me to find out it was Merle who betrayed us.  He has always been a brave soldier, and I had thought his heart was true.  But it is a great relief to have found him out - with a spy like him among us...we would not last long against Colonel Kurzen."
      },
      "summary": "Speak with Lieutenant Doren.",
      "title": "Report to Doren",
